{"id":"943afdb3e6462a3a","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-multiset-extension.md","title":"df-multiset-extension","display":"df-multiset-extension","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-df-multiset-extension","aliases":["56-df-multiset-extension"],"display":"df-multiset-extension","type":"definition","depends_on":[],"source_section":"A.6.1–A.6.3","source_pages":"820–821","source_ocr_blocks":[841,842],"source_statement_status":"checked-against-local-djvu-ocr","source_proof_status":"not-applicable"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-multiset-extension"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-multiset-extension</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-multiset-extension"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"A.6.1–A.6.3"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"820–821"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>841</span><span>842</span></div>"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked-against-local-djvu-ocr"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-applicable"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 为集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq A^2\">\\(Q\\subseteq A^2\\)</span> 为任意二元关系。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathbb N\\)</span> 包含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(A)\">\\(\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(A)\\)</span> 在断言中定义。下列多重集运算公式的参数为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,N,X\\in\\mathcal M_f(A)\">\\(M,N,X\\in\\mathcal M_f(A)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in A\">\\(a\\in A\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M_f(A)\">\\(\\mathcal M_f(A)\\)</span> 在断言首式构造。本节点先对任意关系定义有限多重集提升；在严格序情形它与原书的多重集序一致。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(A)&amp;:=\\{B\\subseteq A\\mid |B|&lt;\\aleph_0\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal M_f(A)&amp;:=\\{M\\in\\mathbb N^A\\mid\\{a\\in A\\mid M(a)&gt;0\\}\\textstyle\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(A)\\},\\\\\n0_A(a)&amp;:=0,\\\\\n(M\\uplus N)(a)&amp;:=M(a)+N(a),\\\\\n(M\\mathbin{\\mathbin{\\dot{-}}}N)(a)&amp;:=\\max\\{M(a)-N(a),0\\},\\\\\nX\\leq M&amp;\\iff\\forall a\\in A\\;(X(a)\\leq M(a)),\\\\\nM\\;Q^{\\mathrm{mul}}\\;N&amp;\\iff\n\\exists X,Y\\in\\mathcal M_f(A)\\;\\bigl[\n0_A\\ne X\\leq M\\land N=(M\\mathbin{\\mathbin{\\dot{-}}}X)\\uplus Y\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{43mm}\\land\\forall y\\in A\\;(Y(y)&gt;0\\Rightarrow\n\\exists x\\in A\\;(X(x)&gt;0\\land xQy))\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(A)&amp;:=\\{B\\subseteq A\\mid |B|&lt;\\aleph_0\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal M_f(A)&amp;:=\\{M\\in\\mathbb N^A\\mid\\{a\\in A\\mid M(a)&gt;0\\}\\textstyle\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(A)\\},\\\\\n0_A(a)&amp;:=0,\\\\\n(M\\uplus N)(a)&amp;:=M(a)+N(a),\\\\\n(M\\mathbin{\\mathbin{\\dot{-}}}N)(a)&amp;:=\\max\\{M(a)-N(a),0\\},\\\\\nX\\leq M&amp;\\iff\\forall a\\in A\\;(X(a)\\leq M(a)),\\\\\nM\\;Q^{\\mathrm{mul}}\\;N&amp;\\iff\n\\exists X,Y\\in\\mathcal M_f(A)\\;\\bigl[\n0_A\\ne X\\leq M\\land N=(M\\mathbin{\\mathbin{\\dot{-}}}X)\\uplus Y\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{43mm}\\land\\forall y\\in A\\;(Y(y)&gt;0\\Rightarrow\n\\exists x\\in A\\;(X(x)&gt;0\\land xQy))\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(A)\">\\(\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(A)\\)</span> 为有限子集族。多重集按出现次数运算；删除一个元素允许替换成空多重集。对严格部分序，以上替换刻画等价于 Definition A.6.2 的单元素替换关系的传递闭包，可由 Exercise A.6.3(ii) 的公共部分消去刻画得到。这里先允许任意 Q，是为递归路径序的构造阶段提供明确定义的提升，不预先假设待构造关系已是序。</p>\n<p>来源：Terese, <em>Term Rewriting Systems</em>, Cambridge University Press, 2003；A.6.1–A.6.3，印刷页 820–821。<code>source_ocr_blocks</code> 是本地 DjVu 文本层提取块序号，不是已确认的物理扫描页号。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"Q\\subseteq A^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"M,N,X\\in\\mathcal M_f(A)","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal M_f(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(A)&:=\\{B\\subseteq A\\mid |B|<\\aleph_0\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal M_f(A)&:=\\{M\\in\\mathbb N^A\\mid\\{a\\in A\\mid M(a)>0\\}\\textstyle\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(A)\\},\\\\\n0_A(a)&:=0,\\\\\n(M\\uplus N)(a)&:=M(a)+N(a),\\\\\n(M\\mathbin{\\mathbin{\\dot{-}}}N)(a)&:=\\max\\{M(a)-N(a),0\\},\\\\\nX\\leq M&\\iff\\forall a\\in A\\;(X(a)\\leq M(a)),\\\\\nM\\;Q^{\\mathrm{mul}}\\;N&\\iff\n\\exists X,Y\\in\\mathcal M_f(A)\\;\\bigl[\n0_A\\ne X\\leq M\\land N=(M\\mathbin{\\mathbin{\\dot{-}}}X)\\uplus Y\\\\\n&\\hspace{43mm}\\land\\forall y\\in A\\;(Y(y)>0\\Rightarrow\n\\exists x\\in A\\;(X(x)>0\\land xQy))\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(A)","display":false}],"bytes":2095,"backlinks":[{"id":"11abe9c52ceec545","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal M_f(\\mathbb N)$ 采用 [[56-df-multiset-extension]] 的有限支撑计数函数约定；$k\\in\\mathbb N$。"},{"id":"45ad3c4764af1fc0","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $A$ 为集合，$Q\\subseteq A^2$，$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}$。$A^n$ 表示以 $[n]$ 为定义域的元组集，$\\mathrm{Sym}([n])$ 为 $[n]$ 上的双射集。取 $\\vec a,\\vec b\\in A^n$、$x\\in A$、$\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Sym}([n])$；$\\mu_n$ 的定义域为 $A^n$，值域为 $\\mathcal M_f(A)$。$\\mathcal M_f(A)$ 和 $Q^{\\mathrm{mul}}$ 见 [[56-df-multiset-extension]]。"},{"id":"6d733f353e873b30","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{DNorm}_R$、$\\nu$ 见 [[56-df-development-measure]]；$>^{\\mathrm{mul}}$ 为自然数严格序 $>$ 的 [[56-df-multiset-extension]] 提升。"},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-212","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-multiset-extension.md]]"},{"id":"fa249af3230be7c7","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $A$ 为集合，$>\\subseteq A^2$，$\\mathrm{StrictOrder}(A,>)$；$\\mathcal M_f(A)$、$>^{\\mathrm{mul}}$ 见 [[56-df-multiset-extension]]，$\\mathrm{WF}$ 沿关系的下降方向解释。"}],"outgoing":[]}